## PRD Feature Coverage Matrix

| PRD Feature | Pass 1 | Pass 2 | Pass 3 | Pass 4 | Pass 5 | Pass 6 | Visual Spec |
|-------------|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|-------------|
| F1 - Canvas | - | Node Palette, Canvas groups | Drag/connect actions | Node choice friction | Node editing states | - | Palette, canvas layout |
| F2 - Device nodes | Mental model: device tree | Device Tree group, Native mode read-only constraint | Port drag affordance | - | Controller online/offline states | Native mode conflict risk | Device Tree Palette component |
| F3 - Delay node | Misconception: "pauses everything" | - | Pause/cancel affordance | Delay+cron confusion | Delay states (5 states, PRD state machine) | Intervention during delay | Delay Node component |
| F4 - Variables | - | Variable Node UX design | Safe editing | Variable scope explanation | Variable execution trace | - | Variable node canvas display |
| F5 - Save workflows | - | - | Safe action | - | Draft/Inactive states | - | - |
| F6 - Duplicate | - | - | Safe action | - | - | - | - |
| F7 - Templates | - | Template Gallery group | Apply = consequential, Save as Template | Device mapping friction | - | Template mapping flow risk | Template Wizard, Device Mapper |
| F8 - MQTT triggers | - | 🔄 MQTT Config group | 🔄 Test connection | 🔄 Topic syntax friction | 🔄 MQTT data freshness | 🔄 MQTT disconnect risk | 🔄 MQTT Trigger Config |
| F9 - Hysteresis | Misconception: sensor flapping | - | - | Hysteresis vs Debounce guidance | Hysteresis state (Triggered/Re-armed) | Forgetting hysteresis risk | Hysteresis Visualizer |
| F10 - Cross-controller | Core value prop | Cross-source relationships | - | Cross-controller unlock onboarding | - | - | Onboarding tooltip |
| F11 - Conflict detection | Misconception: independent workflows | Cross-source relationships | Resolve = consequential | Conflict resolution friction | Conflict states (4 states) | Pre-activation check risk | Conflict Alert Banner |
| F12 - Debounce | - | - | - | Hysteresis vs Debounce guidance | Debounce states (3 states) | - | Debounce Node component |
| F13 - Mode display | Misconception: replaces AC Infinity | Controllers Page group, Read-only constraint on canvas | - | - | Native Mode states | Mode conflicts with workflow | Native Mode Badge |
| F14 - Mode programming | - | Mode Programming Panel design | Consequential action | Mode option complexity | Mode update states | - | Mode Programming panel |

**Legend:** 🔄 = Planned feature (not yet implemented)
